      <title>Tomorrow: 2024 State of the City</title>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">60659413</guid>
      <link>https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/OHCCC/bulletins/39d96d5</link>
      <description>
        <![CDATA[<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="center" class="gd_tbl_wrap"><tr><td style="background-color: #dddddd; margin: 0; padding: 0; width: 100% !important" bgcolor="#dddddd"><table class="main-table" width="600" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="yahoo" style="width: 600px; border-collapse: collapse;">

<tr>
<td style="padding: 15px 0 20px;" class="mobile-padding">
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color: #FFF; border-collapse: collapse;">

<tr>
<td id="header-bg" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Header Background" style="border-left-style: none; border-right-style: none; border-top-style: none; background-color: #000000;" bgcolor="#000000">
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;">
<tr>
<td id="main-header" width="100%" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Main Header" align="center" style="background-color: #00539b; padding: 0px;" bgcolor="#00539b">
<img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2024/05/9431987/5437177/2024-sotc-registration-banner-v1-2_crop.png" style="width: 600px; height: auto !important; max-height: auto !important; border: none;" alt="3D rendering of City of Columbus" width="600" height="300">
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;">
<tr>
<td id="main-body" width="100%" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Main Body" style="padding: 20px;">
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><strong><em>2024 State of the City<br>Tuesday, May 21, 2024, at 6 p.m.<br>Doors open at 5:00 p.m.<br>Lincoln Theatre, 769 E Long St, Columbus, OH 43203</em></strong></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><br>We are at a critical moment in our city’s history – a time when we have an opportunity to get not just bigger, but better.<br><br>I am pleased to invite you to this year's in-person State of the City address on <strong>Tuesday, May 21, at the Lincoln Theatre</strong>. I will share the successes we’ve celebrated and the opportunities on our path forward as we seek to advance safety, transit and housing in America’s Opportunity City.<br><br><strong>Registration is required in order to attend State of the City</strong>. Please register using <a href="https://cityofcolumbus.wildapricot.org/event-5706638/Registration?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">this link</a> or the button below. You will receive a QR code confirmation which will serve as your ticket.<br><br><strong>Free parking is available in the lot across from the Lincoln Theatre on E. Long Street and N. Garfield Avenue and at the Broad Street Presbyterian Church.<abbr data-wawebkitcopymarker="1715177962162"> <br><br></abbr></strong>I look forward to sharing the city's accomplishments and how we are working toward a brighter future in Columbus.<br><br>Sincerely,<br><br></p>
<img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2022/02/5536124/mag-signature_original.png" style="width: 221px; height: auto !important; max-height: auto !important; border: none;" alt="Mayor Andrew Ginther's signature" width="221" height="113"><p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">Andrew J. Ginther,<br>Mayor</p>
<table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;"><tr><td align="center"><a href="https://cityofcolumbus.wildapricot.org/event-5706638/Registration?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;"><img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2024/05/9417420/registerbuttonasset-5_original.png" style="width: 157px; height: auto !important; max-height: auto !important; border: none;" alt="Red button. Text: Register" width="157" height="42"></a></td></tr></table>
</td>
</tr>
